      "id": "claim_e5394fc2b23c4090a110577a79c2decc",
      "statement": "The package's mount contract has two parts in package.json: dsh.bundle.patch points at cordis.patch.yml (which inserts the pet-panel row into the web profile roster, mounting both halves), and dsh.client (platform web, inject of locale/runtime/ui-conversation/ui-layout/ui-sidebar) makes the web module table scan the package into the browser roster and serve lib/client.js.",
