      "statement": "src/index.ts exports a single apply(ctx) that registers exactly six cordis plugins: ProfileSkillProviderPlugin, SkillForgeGateway, ToolIntegrationsGateway, A2AConfigGateway, A2AToolsPlugin, and A2AInboundPlugin.",
