      "id": "claim_19e35002e0e7427ba3345becccdc3423",
      "statement": "ProfileSkillProviderPlugin registers a FileSystemSkillProvider scoped to the current profile's skills/ directory with includeDefaultRoots: false, so only that profile's skills load and the dsh default global root is disabled.",
