    {
      "id": "claim_7a862cd1de6b4de28d28f77e414b1da2",
      "statement": "The three host gateways (SkillForgeGateway, ToolIntegrationsGateway, A2AConfigGateway) are TypertRemoteService subclasses whose public methods carry @Remote(...) decorators; the framework discovers the method set from the typertRemote binding plus the @Remote markers in source mode, so no generated /typert artifact is needed, and each method returns a JSON-safe business value wrapped into a { ok: true, value } | { ok: false, error } envelope.",
