    {
      "id": "claim_7d1e7627fdeb4a27b1742ba8ad906d16",
      "statement": "Per-profile isolation is deterministic: dsh does not chdir to the profile directory or expose it to plugins, so profileNameFromArgv parses --profile from process.argv (always present) and the data roots skillRoot(), MCP_FILE(), and a2aConfigDir() all build $DSH_HOME/profiles/<profile>/... from it, making dsh --profile <name> from any cwd land on the same config as cd <profile> && dsh.",
      "evidence": [
