    {
      "id": "claim_8829db08129249819c513011a3f2ee0b",
      "statement": "The client mounts the Typert namespaces by calling ctx.remote.$mount(TYPERT_REMOTE), where TYPERT_REMOTE is a hand-written manifest in src/client/remote.ts declaring the skillForge, toolIntegrations, and a2aConfig namespaces plus per-method zod wire codecs (JSON position parameters and strict result schemas). The client unwraps each response with a helper that throws r.error.message when r.ok is false.",
