      "id": "claim_7fe15706e9bc4cbb80f1853363bec752",
      "statement": "compact() strips own-properties whose value is undefined before returning a Typert remote result, because zod .optional() fields can otherwise leave an undefined own-property that makes Typert's assertJsonValue throw 'undefined is not JSON-safe' and surface as a bogus 'business result failed boundary validation'.",
