      "id": "claim_41be068aa0cc4ce6a377daea06aaff6f",
      "statement": "The three capability panels (SkillForgeView, ToolIntegrationsView, A2AView) are registered inside a child plugin pet-panel-capabilities whose inject includes the mounted namespace services remote.skillForge, remote.toolIntegrations, and remote.a2aConfig; they cannot live in the main apply(ctx) because ctx there only holds remote and touching remote.skillForge would throw 'without inject'.",
