      "id": "claim_6bbfb251546c4f2d96d20852a003986c",
      "statement": "A2A is wired both directions on the host face: A2AToolsPlugin registers the model-facing a2a_list_agents and a2a_call tools, and a2a_call resolves an agent by exact then normalized then substring then Levenshtein distance (unique hit only), returning a candidate-closure message when resolution fails so the model can retry rather than error; A2AInboundPlugin serves /.well-known/agent-card.json and a JSON-RPC message/send handler at the /a2a prefix, replying via llm.stream using the configured card as the system prompt.",
